{"id":"62e43ba0e25a67c9","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-number-realizability-numeral-substitution.md","title":"Numeral substitution for numerical realizability","display":"lem-number-realizability-numeral-substitution — Numeral substitution for numerical realizability","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-number-realizability-numeral-substitution","aliases":["72-lem-number-realizability-numeral-substitution"],"display":"lem-number-realizability-numeral-substitution — Numeral substitution for numerical realizability","depends_on":["[[72-df-kleene-number-realizability]]","[[72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9","source_location":"Chapter VI, section 1.1 numerical substitution convention, printed p. 408, PDF p. 420; section 1.6 Substitution Property lemma (ii), printed p. 413, PDF p. 425","source_relation":"External environment form of the closed-numeral substitution specialization; not the full partial-term substitution theorem","source_statement_checked":true,"proof_status":"proved-in-note; source-statement-specialization-checked","source_proof_status":"Source formula-induction proof sketch read; local numeral-only induction and binder cases checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"verification_status":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-number-realizability-numeral-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-number-realizability-numeral-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-number-realizability-numeral-substitution — Numeral substitution for numerical realizability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ac651a11b295edf3\" href=\"?note=ac651a11b295edf3\" title=\"72-df-kleene-number-realizability\">72-df-kleene-number-realizability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b0118b1d3360ec7d\" href=\"?note=b0118b1d3360ec7d\" title=\"72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment\">72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Chapter VI, section 1.1 numerical substitution convention, printed p. 408, PDF p. 420; section 1.6 Substitution Property lemma (ii), printed p. 413, PDF p. 425"},{"key":"source_relation","html":"External environment form of the closed-numeral substitution specialization; not the full partial-term substitution theorem"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"proved-in-note; source-statement-specialization-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"Source formula-induction proof sketch read; local numeral-only induction and binder cases checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal A_a\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal A_a\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,i,m\\in\\omega\">\\(n,i,m\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NR}\">\\(\\mathsf{NR}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ac651a11b295edf3\" href=\"?note=ac651a11b295edf3\" title=\"72-df-kleene-number-realizability\">72-df-kleene-number-realizability</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubNum}_a(A,i,m)\">\\(\\operatorname{SubNum}_a(A,i,m)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubNum}_t\">\\(\\operatorname{SubNum}_t\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_\\eta\">\\(\\operatorname{val}_\\eta\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fv}_a,\\operatorname{fv}_t\">\\(\\operatorname{fv}_a,\\operatorname{fv}_t\\)</span> 与环境更新使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b0118b1d3360ec7d\" href=\"?note=b0118b1d3360ec7d\" title=\"72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment\">72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment</a> 的算术语法定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubNum}_a\">\\(\\operatorname{SubNum}_a\\)</span> 将自由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i\">\\(x_i\\)</span> 替换为闭数码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline m\">\\(\\overline m\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NR}(n,\\operatorname{SubNum}_a(A,i,m),\\eta)\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\mathsf{NR}(n,A,\\eta[i\\mapsto m]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{NR}(n,\\operatorname{SubNum}_a(A,i,m),\\eta)\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\mathsf{NR}(n,A,\\eta[i\\mapsto m]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>先对项结构归纳，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(t,i,m))=\\operatorname{val}_{\\eta[i\\mapsto m]}(t)\">\\(\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(t,i,m))=\\operatorname{val}_{\\eta[i\\mapsto m]}(t)\\)</span>。再同时检查环境局部性：在自由变量集上一致的两个环境给出相同的项值与 NR 真值。原子与各联结词直接由定义或子公式归纳得到；蕴涵中对输入 m 的量化使用同一个固定计算结构，不因环境改变而漂移。</p>\n<p>量词绑定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_j\">\\(x_j\\)</span> 时分两种情形。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\ne i\">\\(j\\ne i\\)</span>，环境更新在不同指标处交换，闭数码没有自由变量，使用矩阵的归纳假设即可。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j=i\">\\(j=i\\)</span>，数码代入在该量词处停止；量词子句的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta[i\\mapsto k]\">\\(\\eta[i\\mapsto k]\\)</span> 覆盖之前的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta[i\\mapsto m]\">\\(\\eta[i\\mapsto m]\\)</span>，两侧一致。由此全部构造子均成立。此原子只做数码代入，未扩展到任意含自由变量项，因而不偷省一般代入的防捕获条件；原书 p.413 的完整部分项代入性质仍在范围外。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-kleene-number-realizability","status":"resolved","id":"ac651a11b295edf3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-kleene-number-realizability]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment","status":"resolved","id":"b0118b1d3360ec7d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-kleene-number-realizability","status":"resolved","id":"ac651a11b295edf3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathcal A_a$，$n,i,m\\in\\omega$，$\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega$；$\\mathsf{NR}$ 采用 [[72-df-kleene-number-realizability]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment","status":"resolved","id":"b0118b1d3360ec7d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SubNum}_a(A,i,m)$、$\\operatorname{SubNum}_t$、$\\operatorname{val}_\\eta$、$\\operatorname{fv}_a,\\operatorname{fv}_t$ 与环境更新使用 [[72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment]] 的算术语法定义；$\\operatorname{SubNum}_a$ 将自由 $x_i$ 替换为闭数码 $\\overline m$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal A_a","display":false},{"tex":"n,i,m\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{NR}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SubNum}_a(A,i,m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SubNum}_t","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}_\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{fv}_a,\\operatorname{fv}_t","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SubNum}_a","display":false},{"tex":"x_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline m","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{NR}(n,\\operatorname{SubNum}_a(A,i,m),\\eta)\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\mathsf{NR}(n,A,\\eta[i\\mapsto m]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(t,i,m))=\\operatorname{val}_{\\eta[i\\mapsto m]}(t)","display":false},{"tex":"x_j","display":false},{"tex":"j\\ne i","display":false},{"tex":"j=i","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta[i\\mapsto k]","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta[i\\mapsto m]","display":false}],"bytes":2777,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-318","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-lem-number-realizability-numeral-substitution|lem-number-realizability-numeral-substitution — Numeral substitution for numerical realizability]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-316","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[lem-number-realizability-numeral-substitution — Numeral substitution for numerical realizability](72-lem-number-realizability-numeral-substitution.md)"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-340","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-lem-number-realizability-numeral-substitution|lem-number-realizability-numeral-substitution — Numeral substitution for numerical realizability]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-394","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-lem-number-realizability-numeral-substitution]]"}],"outgoing":["ac651a11b295edf3","b0118b1d3360ec7d"]}